### Platform integration > Android > Android platform-views > Overview

Source: https://docs.flutter.dev/platform-integration/platform-views

Platform views allow you to embed native views in a Flutter app, so you can apply transforms, clips, and opacity to the native view from Dart. This allows you, for example, to use the native Google Maps from the Android SDK directly inside your Flutter app.

